{"title": "Shortest path with at most k stops", "view": "graph", "steps": [{"nodes": [{"id": "0", "x": 0, "y": 1}, {"id": "1", "x": 1.6, "y": 0}, {"id": "2", "x": 1.6, "y": 2}, {"id": "3", "x": 3.2, "y": 1}], "edges": [{"from": "0", "to": "1", "w": 100}, {"from": "1", "to": "2", "w": 100}, {"from": "2", "to": "0", "w": 100}, {"from": "1", "to": "3", "w": 600}, {"from": "2", "to": "3", "w": 200}], "directed": true, "values": {"0": "0", "1": "\u221e", "2": "\u221e", "3": "\u221e"}, "vars": {"k stops": 1, "rounds": 2}, "caption": "Cheapest flight 0 \u2192 3 with at most 1 stop = at most 2 flights. Bellman-Ford: each round lets every path use one more flight."}, {"nodes": [{"id": "0", "x": 0, "y": 1}, {"id": "1", "x": 1.6, "y": 0}, {"id": "2", "x": 1.6, "y": 2}, {"id": "3", "x": 3.2, "y": 1}], "edges": [{"from": "0", "to": "1", "w": 100}, {"from": "1", "to": "2", "w": 100}, {"from": "2", "to": "0", "w": 100}, {"from": "1", "to": "3", "w": 600}, {"from": "2", "to": "3", "w": 200}], "directed": true, "edgeHighlight": [["0", "1"]], "values": {"0": "0", "1": "100", "2": "\u221e", "3": "\u221e"}, "vars": {"round": 1}, "caption": "Round 1: relax every flight using LAST round's prices (a copy), so no path gains two flights in one round."}, {"nodes": [{"id": "0", "x": 0, "y": 1}, {"id": "1", "x": 1.6, "y": 0}, {"id": "2", "x": 1.6, "y": 2}, {"id": "3", "x": 3.2, "y": 1}], "edges": [{"from": "0", "to": "1", "w": 100}, {"from": "1", "to": "2", "w": 100}, {"from": "2", "to": "0", "w": 100}, {"from": "1", "to": "3", "w": 600}, {"from": "2", "to": "3", "w": 200}], "directed": true, "edgeHighlight": [["1", "2"], ["1", "3"]], "values": {"0": "0", "1": "100", "2": "200", "3": "700"}, "vars": {"round": 2}, "caption": "Round 2: relax every flight using LAST round's prices (a copy), so no path gains two flights in one round. 0 \u2192 1 \u2192 3 = 700 fits in 2 flights; 0 \u2192 1 \u2192 2 \u2192 3 = 400 would need 3."}, {"nodes": [{"id": "0", "x": 0, "y": 1}, {"id": "1", "x": 1.6, "y": 0}, {"id": "2", "x": 1.6, "y": 2}, {"id": "3", "x": 3.2, "y": 1}], "edges": [{"from": "0", "to": "1", "w": 100}, {"from": "1", "to": "2", "w": 100}, {"from": "2", "to": "0", "w": 100}, {"from": "1", "to": "3", "w": 600}, {"from": "2", "to": "3", "w": 200}], "directed": true, "highlight": ["3"], "values": {"0": "0", "1": "100", "2": "200", "3": "700"}, "caption": "Answer 700. Plain Dijkstra would find 400, which breaks the stop limit. O(k \u00b7 E)."}]}
